# Repo language

Operator-facing text in this repo is English: script prompts, log lines a person reads while running a tool, and text written into those prompts.

When a tool asks a person to judge a place, name the files in the prompt with this sentence:

```
(open the following in qgis or similar tool to check: [path one, path two])
```

Use the paths of the files that show the stretch in question. A question without those paths is incomplete.
